an begin="00:41.330" end="00:41.750">If </span><span begin="00:41.750" end="00:41.960">I </span><span begin="00:41.960" end="00:42.500">lay </span><span begin="00:42.500" end="00:44.270">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.890" end="00:49.520"><span begin="00:45.890" end="00:46.370">If </span><span begin="00:46.370" end="00:46.550">I </span><span begin="00:46.550" end="00:47.180">just </span><span begin="00:47.180" end="00:47.990">lay </span><span begin="00:47.990" end="00:49.520">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.420" end="00:53.300"><span begin="00:50.420" end="00:50.900">Would </span><span begin="00:50.900" end="00:51.200">you </span><span begin="00:51.200" end="00:51.710">lie </span><span begin="00:51.710" end="00:52.640">with </span><span begin="00:52.640" end="00:53.300">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.300" end="01:02.960"><span begin="00:53.300" end="00:54.020">and </span><span begin="00:54.020" end="00:54.410">just </span><span begin="00:54.410" end="00:55.220">forget </span><span begin="00:55.220" end="00:55.370">the </span><span begin="00:55.370" end="00:56.990">world</span><span begin="00:56.990" end="01:02.960">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.960" end="01:06.740"><span begin="01:02.960" end="01:03.170">I </span><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:04.070">don't </span><span begin="01:04.070" end="01:04.940">quite </span><span begin="01:04.940" end="01:06.740">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.820" end="01:10.850"><span begin="01:07.820" end="01:08.660">How </span><span begin="01:08.660" end="01:09.470">to </span><span begin="01:09.470" end="01:10.850">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.350" end="01:16.070"><span begin="01:12.350" end="01:13.400">How </span><span begin="01:13.400" end="01:14.090">I </span><span begin="01:14.090" end="01:16.070">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.590" end="01:25.220"><span begin="01:21.590" end="01:22.640">Those </span><span begin="01:22.640" end="01: